---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article class="article">
    <h1>About {SITE.name}</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        {SITE.name} is an independent public-interest publication that documents
        allegations, investigations and court proceedings involving politicians
        and public figures in India. Our goal is simple: make information that
        already exists in the public record easier to find, read and verify.
      </p>
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We compile information from court filings, official agency reports, election affidavits, audits, and credible published journalism.</li>
        <li>We link every claim to its source so readers can check it themselves.</li>
        <li>We clearly mark the legal status of each matter — allegation, investigation, trial, conviction or acquittal.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We do not invent facts or publish rumours we cannot source.</li>
        <li>We do not state that someone is guilty of a crime unless a court has convicted them.</li>
        <li>We do not accept funding or instructions from political parties or candidates.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Corrections & right of reply</h2>
      <p>
        If you believe something we published is inaccurate, or you are a subject
        of a report and wish to respond, please use the
        <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page. We review every request and correct
        genuine errors promptly, with a visible note.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
